estion/worked-solution "Since our circle is centered at the origin and has a radius of $6,$ its equation is given by\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}={6}^{2}\\,⟹\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=36.\n$$\n\nNow, to calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we use implicit differentiation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(36) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({y}^{2}) & =0 \\\\ 2x+2y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =0 \\\\ 2y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-2x \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{x}{y}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186545153 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0bc93ec0-549b-5e46-9551-fda0a82655d5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{2x}{y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186545115} {:answer/id #uuid "235db8d9-acc6-5a46-9075-6467141ed519" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{y}{x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186545119} {:answer/id #uuid "5a7393f4-2cf5-55d5-8167-ec16ac6df4d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{x}{y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186545136} {:answer/id #uuid "b385b497-bc68-522b-a1a3-05df444e4127" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{x}{2y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186545160} {:answer/id #uuid "c7b8585c-9f13-57c3-a09c-643714766156" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{x}{y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186545170}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c7b8585c-9f13-57c3-a09c-643714766156" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{x}{y}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186545170} :answer-field/id #uuid "323110a3-94ab-51e9-8c12-92581d876adb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186545126}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9cf8f1f1-1685-5bb2-af84-7927e3467e26" 